# Marquee iOS

Native SwiftUI app under `ios/`. Reuses Express JWT API in `backend-server/`. See `ios/DESIGN.md`.

## Palette (locked — Lobby Light)

- Salt Grey `#E5E5DE` — light surface
- Deep Olive `#3D3B2E` — ink / dark chrome
- Hibiscus Pink `#FF4F8B` — actions only (CTAs, mark, rate, progress)
- Dark surface `#1C1B16`, elevated `#2A281F`; dark text uses Salt Grey
- Never introduce Butter Yellow, Acid Citron, Haze Lavender, purple/indigo gradients, or a second accent

## Liquid Glass

- Glass on chrome only: tab bar, toolbars, sheets, search, FABs
- No `.glassEffect()` on posters, list rows, or full-screen backgrounds
- Prefer system `TabView`, `ToolbarItem`, `sheet`, `searchable`
- Group custom glass in `GlassEffectContainer`

## Code

- SwiftUI + `@Observable`; async/await networking; Keychain for JWT
- Bearer token on all protected routes; clear session on 401
- Image loading: cached/downsampled posters (not raw `AsyncImage` for rails)
- Motion: 100–250ms springs; Reduce Motion respected
- Copy: short diary voice; no AI filler

## API

- Base URL from config (debug: `http://localhost:5001`)
- TMDB via `GET /api/tmdb/...` only — never embed TMDB API keys in the client
